From b3a644b051a6c1f33552122bd1795fa3b0e98044 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amir Latipov <kimciwork@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:02:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(ai-lab): per-player SkirmishScripts.scb in -aiMatch

-aiPlayer Faction:difficulty[:path.scb] gives one AI player its own skirmish
scripts and teams. Player::initFromDict swaps the skirmish templates for the
file's ones while copying, then restores the shared ones. Scb file loading is
moved out of SidesList::prepareForMP_or_Skirmish unchanged. Result JSON
schema 3 adds per-player "scripts".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
